 *
 * @remarks Expiry is set with an `ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRY_BUFFER_MS` (60 s) lead
 *          buffer (`now + expires_in*1000 − 60s`) so a token expiring mid-request
 *          still triggers a refresh.
